      "formatted_webpage_T002": "<div class='report'>\n  <h1>\ud83d\udcca Countdown Timer Webpage Analysis Report</h1>\n\n  <div class='executive-summary'>\n    <h2>\ud83c\udfaf Executive Summary</h2>\n    <p>This report analyzes the provided HTML, CSS, and JavaScript code for a countdown timer webpage. The webpage features a dark theme and displays a timer counting down from 5 minutes to zero. The analysis covers the code structure, visual appearance, and potential improvements.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class='code-analysis'>\n    <h2>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udcbb Code Analysis</h2>\n\n    <h3>HTML Structure</h3>\n    <p>The HTML structure is simple and effective. It includes a container div and an h1 element with the id \"timerDisplay\" to display the timer. The CSS and JavaScript files are linked correctly.</p>\n    <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n    &lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;\n    &lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;\n    &lt;title&gt;Countdown Timer&lt;/title&gt;\n    &lt;link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\"&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n    &lt;div class=\"container\"&gt;\n        &lt;h1 id=\"timerDisplay\"&gt;5:00&lt;/h1&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;script src=\"script.js\"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>\n\n    <h3>CSS Styling</h3>\n    <p>The CSS provides a dark theme with a dark background and light text. The timer is centered on the page and uses a large, bold font.</p>\n    <pre><code>body {\n    background-color: #222;\n    color: #eee;\n    font-family: sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n\n.container {\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n#timerDisplay {\n    font-size: 5em;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n</code></pre>\n\n    <h3>JavaScript Logic</h3>\n    <p>The JavaScript code initializes the timer with 5 minutes (300 seconds). It updates the timer display every second and displays \"Time's up!\" when the timer reaches zero.</p>\n    <pre><code>const timerDisplay = document.getElementById('timerDisplay');\nlet timeLeft = 300; // 5 minutes in seconds\n\nfunction updateTimer() {\n    let minutes = Math.floor(timeLeft / 60);\n    let seconds = timeLeft % 60;\n    seconds = seconds &lt; 10 ? '0' + seconds : seconds;\n    timerDisplay.textContent = `${minutes}:${seconds}`;\n    timeLeft--;\n\n    if (timeLeft &lt; 0) {\n        timerDisplay.textContent = \"Time's up!\";\n        clearInterval(timerInterval);\n    }\n}\n\nconst timerInterval = setInterval(updateTimer, 1000);\n</code></pre>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class='visual-breakdown'>\n    <h2>\ud83c\udfa8 Visual Breakdown</h2>\n\n    <h3>Color Palette</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Background: #222 (Dark Gray)</li>\n      <li>Text: #eee (Light Gray)</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>Typography</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Font Family: sans-serif</li>\n      <li>Font Size: 5em (for timer display)</li>\n      <li>Font Weight: Bold (for timer display)</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>Layout</h3>\n    <p>The timer is centered both horizontally and vertically on the page.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class='potential-improvements'>\n    <h2>\u2728 Potential Improvements</h2>\n\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Add Interactivity:</strong> Include start, pause, and reset buttons to control the timer.</li>\n      <li><strong>Visual Enhancements:</strong> Use a more visually appealing font and add animations or transitions.</li>\n      <li><strong>Customizable Timer:</strong> Allow users to set the initial timer value.</li>\n      <li><strong>Notifications:</strong> Implement audio or visual notifications when the timer reaches zero.</li>\n      <li><strong>Responsive Design:</strong> Ensure the webpage is responsive and looks good on different screen sizes.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class='code-snippets'>\n    <h2>\ud83d\udcbb Code Snippets for Improvements</h2>\n    <h3>Adding